# (build 143) The click a sound effect's end made under VOICES EXTRA, the
# default (The owner: "a slight click after pushing the continue button
# on dialog boxes"). Every stop in a dialog plays the selection sound on
# FM5, ten ticks; at its end RestoreBGMChn gives the channel back to the
# music by uploading the music track's instrument (SetFMIns, then the
# track's volume, RefreshVolume). On the one chip that lands on the
# channel the effect was sounding, and the upload's few writes at the
# instrument's own levels go unheard. Under EXTRA the music's part played
# on under the effect on a voice of its own, and those writes, up to 27 dB
# over the track's volume for a few write slots, were a click on its
# sounding note -- on the chip (A, the music's) and on Q alike. Now that
# upload reaches the effect's releasing voice only (smps.h,
# SMPS_HOOK_RESTORE; docs/audio.md, "Build 143").
#
# The Governor's briefing, each stop pressed and 18 ticks waited (the
# music's place at each end depends on it). `expect sound clicks below`:
# the sharpest bend (second difference) over the last four ticks rendered.
# Eleven ticks after the press the window holds the effect's end. Fails on
# 142d: -18.7, -18.8 and -16.0 dBFS at stops 4, 9 and 10 (-32.4, -36.6 and
# -37.0 now); everywhere else the two are the same to the tick.

start building 14 23 0 0 32 16      # the Governor; the street is 32,16
sound render on
wait idle
press c                             # stop 1
wait ticks 18
wait idle
press c                             # stop 2
wait ticks 18
wait idle
press c                             # stop 3
wait ticks 18
wait idle
press c                             # stop 4
wait ticks 11
expect sound clicks below -28       # the selection's end: -18.7 on 142d
expect sound playing
wait ticks 7
wait idle
press c                             # stop 5
wait ticks 18
wait idle
press c                             # stop 6
wait ticks 18
wait idle
press c                             # stop 7
wait ticks 18
wait idle
press c                             # stop 8
wait ticks 18
wait idle
press c                             # stop 9
wait ticks 11
expect sound clicks below -28       # -18.8 on 142d
wait ticks 7
wait idle
press c                             # stop 10
wait ticks 11
expect sound clicks below -28       # -16.0 on 142d
wait ticks 7
expect script $1101
expect no-stderr not ported
